    "long_instructions": "# Build a Static Web Page\r\n\r\n1.  **Build the Structure:** With the help of AI, write the HTML and CSS to match your wireframe. Create an empty `script.js` file and ensure you have imported both the `script.js` and `dataset.js` files from your `index.html` file.\r\n2.  **Consult AI:** Use the AI Assistant to help plan your JavaScript logic to display all cards in the dataset. You might ask:\r\n      * *Help me write a function that takes my array of data and displays it as HTML cards.*\r\n      * *How do I use a loop to add multiple items to my container div?*\r\n3.  **Render the Data:** In `script.js`, write a function that reads in the data from `dataset.js` and loops through your dataset to display all the cards when the page loads.",
